  <div class="container article-body" style="max-width:920px;">
    <h2>What Are DQ Cheese Curds?</h2>
  <p>DQ Cheese Curds are Wisconsin-style white cheddar cheese curds — fresh, squeaky cheese in nugget form — dipped in batter and deep-fried. The result is a golden, crispy exterior with a gooey, molten cheese interior. They are served immediately after frying, so the cheese inside is at peak melt. Find the full snacks lineup on <a href="/">The Queen Dairy Menu</a>.</p>
  <h2>Best DQ Snack for Sharing</h2>
  <p>At $3.99 for a generous portion, Cheese Curds are the best value shareable snack on the DQ menu. They pair well with any dipping sauce — ranch is the most popular pairing, but they also work with the Country Gravy sauce available alongside <a href="/items/chicken-strip-basket-4pc">Chicken Strip Baskets</a>.</p>
  <h2>Cheese Curds vs. Pretzel Sticks — Which to Order?</h2>
