    <h2>Cheese Curds — Dipping Sauce Recommendations</h2>
    <p>Cheese Curds do not come with a sauce — they are served as-is. But most DQ locations allow you to request dipping sauces on the side:</p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Ranch</strong> — The most popular pairing. Cool, creamy, herb notes cut through the richness.</li>
      <li><strong>Country Gravy</strong> — If you can get it with your order. The classic DQ dipping sauce pairs surprisingly well with the white cheddar.</li>
      <li><strong>BBQ Sauce</strong> — Smoky and sweet against the salty cheddar.</li>
      <li><strong>No sauce</strong> — Fresh out of the fryer, the curds are flavorful enough without dipping.</li>
    </ul>
    <h2>Cheese Curds as Part of a Meal</h2>
    <p>The <a href="/items/2-for-5-mix-match">2-for-$5 Mix &amp; Match</a> does not typically include Cheese Curds as an eligible item (they are priced above the deal threshold). Order them as an add-on to a burger or sandwich for a complete meal. A <a href="/items/backyard-bacon-ranch-stackburger">Backyard Bacon Ranch Stackburger</a> + Cheese Curds = approximately $13.98 for a very satisfying meal.</p>
